{
  "project": {
    "name": "D-Shaft Replacement Knob",
    "slug": "knob-dshaft",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A right-to-repair replacement knob for a drawer, cabinet, appliance, or dial. Measure the broken shaft and pick the matching bore — round, single D-flat, double-D, or splined — then choose a cylindrical, knurled, or fluted grip. A pointer variant adds a raised indicator line for dials. An optional set-screw locks it on.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Una perilla de repuesto de derecho a reparar para cajón, gabinete, electrodoméstico o dial. Mide el eje roto y elige el barreno correspondiente — redondo, D plano simple, doble D o estriado — luego elige un agarre cilíndrico, moleteado o estriado. Una variante con indicador agrega una línea en relieve para diales. Un prisionero opcional la fija.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/knob-dshaft.webp",
    "difficulty": "beginner",
    "tags": [
      "knob",
